⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of David Van Patten
node APX · APX · ⟦David Van Patten:APX:a0b582⟧

WHO   — David Van Patten — interchangeable by design
WHAT  — Another member of the uniform set — there to make the roomful of clones complete, and the card-comparison apocalyptic.
WHERE — APX · American Psycho  Framework inputs: American Psycho (2000, dir. Mary Harron); Ellis's novel (1991)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the horror of sameness needs a critical mass of the same; he is the third data point that makes it a pattern.
HOW   — By the suit, the slang, and the seamless blending into a crowd of himself.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  I'm the third one you can't tell from the other two — which is exactly the joke, and exactly the indictment.

